# A [[device]] used for automatically stopping a [[machine]] or [[engine]] when a fault or error is detected.<ref>'''stop''', combinations section (''Comb.''), '''stop-motion''' a device for automatically stopping a machine or engine when something has gone wrong (''The New Shorter Oxford English Dictionary'', Clarendon Press, Oxford, Vol. 2 N-Z, 1993 edition, see page 3,074)</ref>

